{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/extras/4c2fb90498db5934d80ad39d696c1be4.poster.avif?t=1764203447\" width=920 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/extras/4c2fb90498db5934d80ad39d696c1be4.webm?t=1764203447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/extras/4c2fb90498db5934d80ad39d696c1be4.mp4?t=1764203447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Honk Havoc, there is no stopping. Every jump is inevitable, and every landing a matter of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of a cursed duck, forever doomed to bounce across an archipelago of deadly traps, treacherous platforms, and merciless spikes. As you progress from island to island, challenges become tougher and lead you through frantic duels against eccentric bosses guarding clues to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hunt for the legendary sandwich requires pinpoint accuracy and nerves of steel. Time every forced jump, memorize chaotic patterns, react to unpredictable hazards, and keep your rhythm through the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its bright pixel art and tight, challenging gameplay, Honk Havoc is an intense and fast-paced experience. Take part in the epic journey of a duck determined to break his own curse, one jump at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367640?t=1764203447","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/c0f4636fde7ce793f2869eb5ebe69b4f9a701537/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764203447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/f6afc8cc85f389ab4de1e8ebebcba9cbb1637a77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764203447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/f6afc8cc85f389ab4de1e8ebebcba9cbb1637a77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764203447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/extras/4c2fb90498db5934d80ad39d696c1be4.poster.avif?t=1764203447\" width=920 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/extras/4c2fb90498db5934d80ad39d696c1be4.webm?t=1764203447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/extras/4c2fb90498db5934d80ad39d696c1be4.mp4?t=1764203447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Honk Havoc, there is no stopping. Every jump is inevitable, and every landing a matter of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of a cursed duck, forever doomed to bounce across an archipelago of deadly traps, treacherous platforms, and merciless spikes. As you progress from island to island, challenges become tougher and lead you through frantic duels against eccentric bosses guarding clues to your next destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hunt for the legendary sandwich requires pinpoint accuracy and nerves of steel. Time every forced jump, memorize chaotic patterns, react to unpredictable hazards, and keep your rhythm through the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its bright pixel art and tight, challenging gameplay, Honk Havoc is an intense and fast-paced experience. Take part in the epic journey of a duck determined to break his own curse, one jump at a time.</p>","developers":["Richterkatze Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367640/2f85bbf7e238f90757bb96e9bd4f79fe2a62c812/header.jpg?t=1764203447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3367640/49602338/442b08f82ee142a9bc69db5ccfd0ea6c6c1e5bfe/1763576387/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763576873","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3367640/49602338/442b08f82ee142a9bc69db5ccfd0ea6c6c1e5bfe/1763576387/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763576873","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3367640/49602338/442b08f82ee142a9bc69db5ccfd0ea6c6c1e5bfe/1763576387/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763576873","id":257234389,"name":"honk havoc trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257234389/833703b48cfd8ea9bbb4468326f6d0d355e0a0d6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763576873"}],"name":"Honk Havoc","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I